    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start. Could you make it slightly more personalized? I want to mention that their experience with Kubernetes and cloud security specifically stood out to the hiring team, but emphasize that we're looking for a slightly different niche for this particular role. Can you integrate that into the second paragraph?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a revised draft:\n\n\"Dear [Candidate Name],\n\nI wanted to personally reach out to you regarding the Senior DevOps Engineer position at [Company Name]. We were truly impressed by your exceptional technical skills and the way you embodied our company's values. Your passion for DevOps and commitment to collaboration are traits that we highly value, and it was a tough decision to make.\n\nAfter careful consideration, we have decided to move forward with another candidate whose skills and experience better align with our current needs. While your expertise in Kubernetes and cloud security were particularly notable, we're looking for a more specialized DevOps engineer to focus on our specific use case, which involves a unique combination of on-premises infrastructure and cloud-based services. Your strengths in these areas are undeniable, but we felt that this particular role required a more tailored approach. Please know that this decision is in no way a reflection on your abilities or potential as a professional. You have a bright future ahead of you, and we have no doubt that you will excel in your next endeavor.\n\nWe appreciate the time and effort you invested in our interview process, and we're grateful for the opportunity to have met you. If you have any questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to reach out",
